# Mark vendored dependency trees as binary for diff purposes.
#
# scripts/platinumlist-api/node_modules was committed to this repository by
# mistake. Untracking it spans ~800 files and ~590k lines, which exceeds
# GitHub's API diff limits (300 files / 20,000 lines per pull request), so
# the deletion cannot be reviewed or CI-gated as a normal textual diff.
#
# Marking the path as `-diff` makes GitHub emit a one-line
# "Binary files differ" entry instead of the full file body, which keeps
# every part of the removal reviewable and lets the content gate run.
scripts/platinumlist-api/node_modules/** -diff
